          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Pricing Log in Sign up Blog Docs Get Support Contact Sales Log in Sign up The Inference Cloud built for scale — without complexity or surprise costs. Sign up with email Sign up with Google Sign up with GitHub Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Gradient™ AI Inference Cloud Whether you’re training large models, running inference, or creating AI-driven applications, Gradient™ AI enables you to build, deploy, and scale with ease."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enterprise-grade infrastructure trusted by 600K+ customers running AI inference, serving thousands of requests, and executing every big idea in between. Customers growing with DigitalOcean See how developers and startups around the globe are building and scaling their applications on DigitalOcean while saving money."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See all customer stories"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Head of AI, Scribe"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Scribe serves 4 million AI users with DigitalOcean GPUs"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Zoltan Bettenbuk CTO, ScraperAPI"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The cost of running ScraperAPI would be 250% more on AWS, as compared to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Kyle Campbell Founder, CTO.ai"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "CTO.ai on Migrating to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yury Kamyshenko Head of R&amp;D, Cyprus, Tango"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "It’s not only about the price, it’s also about proving stability, proving a quality level of support and understanding our business. These factors led us to continue to grow on DigitalOcean."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Richard Li Founder &amp; CEO, Amorphous Data"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Amorphous Data on DigitalOcean GPUs and Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Andres Murcia CTO, Picap"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "We were previously on AWS but started migrating everything because we really love DigitalOcean in terms of cost and support. We saved a lot of money—we went from $120,000 to $30,000 [per month]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Matt Gray CEO, Servd Hosting"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "How Servd Scaled Their Craft CMS Platform with DigitalOcean Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Travis Beale CTO, Consumable"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The VIP support has been excellent. If there’s an issue, it’s always engineers on the line, not somebody who is two steps removed from the people that know what’s going on."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Mouad Hadji Head of AI, Scribe"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Scribe serves 4 million AI users with DigitalOcean GPUs"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Zoltan Bettenbuk CTO, ScraperAPI"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The cost of running ScraperAPI would be 250% more on AWS, as compared to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Kyle Campbell Founder, CTO.ai"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "CTO.ai on Migrating to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yury Kamyshenko Head of R&amp;D, Cyprus, Tango"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "It’s not only about the price, it’s also about proving stability, proving a quality level of support and understanding our business. These factors led us to continue to grow on DigitalOcean."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Richard Li Founder &amp; CEO, Amorphous Data"
          },
          {
