          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Persistent compute, high-throughput storage, scalable runtime environments—everything you need to go from “uhhh” to agent, fast. A unified inference cloud to build full-stack AI apps Train, fine-tune, and run cost-effective inference on infrastructure designed for building, deploying, and scaling high-performance apps and agents."
          },
          {
